# Thousand Needles (Horde) - Rares & Treasures companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# An opportunistic sweep for the 7 confirmed flagged rares of Thousand
# Needles a Horde player can actually engage, the two item-start hunts of
# the Horde core (the Assassination Note and the Cracked Carapace), and the
# fixed Solid Chests. Run it in its own Polestar tab at the end of the core
# route or standalone. EVERY goal is optional: a rare that is not up never
# holds the route. Spawn points and levels are the local Forever game data
# (questie-forever); signature drops are items whose SOLE dropper is the
# rare. All 7 rares are faction-null (neutral), so nothing is gated out for
# Horde. Three rares sit above the 20-32 band and ship with honest
# come-back-later notes (sole signatures argue for them). No tame lines
# ship (the data has no tameability flag and the Horde core guide carries
# no tame corroboration — see docs/companion-unverified.md). Respawn
# timers are unconfirmed anywhere, so none are stated. The two hunts point
# at the Horde core guide, which owns the accepts and turnins; the Shaman
# Eye objective, the Wanted Poster and the Document Chests are core-owned
# furniture and get no hunt here. See
# docs/thousand-needles-horde-companions-inventory.md for the full
# inventory this guide was built against.
guide butler-routes-completionist/thousand-needles-horde-rares
title Thousand Needles (Horde) - Rares & Treasures
levels 20-32
zone Thousand Needles
faction Horde
category Collectibles
folder Companions
keywords thousand needles, horde, rares, treasures, companions
coords live
version 1

step Harb Foulmountain — the north

  zone map 1441

  goto 32.55,26.78
  kill 14426 optional
  collect 285212 "Foulmountain Family Hammer" optional
  note Level 27 rare at its single confirmed point in the north; its sole drop is the Foulmountain Family Hammer. No quest takes it.
  note Also drops ordinary greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Heartrazor — the west

  zone map 1441

  goto 16.75,41.49
  kill 5934 optional
  collect 285190 "Wyvern Heart Band" optional
  note Level 32 rare at its single confirmed point in the west; its sole drop is the Wyvern Heart Band. No quest takes it.
  note Also drops ordinary greens; respawn timer unconfirmed. Hunters: Heartrazor is a wyvern but there is no data flag for tameability and the core route never corroborates a wyvern tame — see docs/companion-unverified.md.

