step Galak Messenger hunt — Assassination Note (core 4881)

  zone map 1441

  goto 39.43,33.1
  kill 10617 optional
  collect 12564 "Assassination Note" optional
  note The Note starts core quest 4881 Assassination Plot in your bags — the Horde core guide owns the accept (Kanati Greycloud) and turnin. This step only hunts the starter.

step Silithid grounds hunt — Cracked Carapace (core 1148)

  zone map 1441

  loop
  goto 63.51,85.8
  goto 67.72,83.51
  goto 67.06,82.47
  goto 69.03,83.14
  kill 4130 optional
  collect 5877 "Cracked Silithid Carapace" optional
  note The Carapace starts core quest 1148 Parts of the Swarm in your bags — the Horde core guide owns the accept and the Korran turnin. Farm the Searcher/Invader/Hive Drone grounds south; the intact carapaces are the parallel drop, not the starter.

step Silithid Ravager — Shimmering Flats east (come back later)

  zone map 1441

  loop
  goto 67.26,86.1
  goto 68.38,82.32
  goto 70.03,86.22
  kill 4132 optional
  collect 8224 "Silithid Ripper" optional
  note Level 37 rare, above the 20-32 band — come back in the high 30s. Loops its 3 confirmed points in the Flats east; its sole drop is the Silithid Ripper. No quest takes it.
  note Also drops ordinary greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Vile Sting — the south-east (come back later)

  zone map 1441

  goto 70.55,72.92
  kill 5937 optional
  collect 285177 "Nature's Sting Legguards" optional
  note Level 35 rare, above the 20-32 band — come back in the mid 30s. Single confirmed point in the south-east; its sole drop is the Nature's Sting Legguards.
  note Also drops Salty Scorpid Venom, the objective of Salt Flat Venom (1104) — that quest lives in the ungated main guide, which owns its accept and turnin. Hunters: scorpid tameability is unconfirmed in the data — see docs/companion-unverified.md.

