step Lost Shipping Crate — the Flats (come back at 36)

  zone map 1441

  goto 45.33,49.18
  note The crate here starts 94930 Lost Shipping Crate, a level-38 Horde quest above this guide's 20-32 band (turnin Friz Frazzlespark in the Riverglades) — come back at 36. No goal rides here; companions never accept quests.
